{
    "title": "Number Clash - Math Game",
    "description": "<b>Discover the exciting new app, Number Clash - Math Game! Match your way to a higher score with this fun and challenging number game. Find pairs of numbers to clear the board in the best way to test your memory, improve your math skills, and have a blast with our addictive number puzzle.</b>\r\n\r\nNumber Clash - Math Game is an engaging number puzzle app with straightforward rules: score and win by finding pairs of numbers and removing them from the board. Spend your free time wisely with Number Clash. Develop logical thinking, test your problem-solving skills, and enhance your focus\u2014all by playing this classic number match game.\r\n\r\nThis classic numbers game, also known as \"make ten\", \"collect ten\", \"numbers\", \"seeds\" or \"column\", will appeal to all number puzzle lovers.\r\n\r\nDo you play and enjoy Sudoku or regular and Japanese crosswords and other number games? This number game app is perfect for you to boost brain power in your free time. Unobtrusive music and pleasant graphics add to the relaxing game experience.\r\n\r\nNumber Clash - Math Game is an engaging number puzzle app with simple rules. This game allows users to relax while matching pairs of numbers in grids. It helps develop basic math and arithmetic skills, improves concentration, and enhances problem-solving abilities. That's why Number Clash is an excellent learning tool for younger players!\r\n\r\n<b>How to play Number Clash - Math Game</b>\r\n\r\n- Cross out the pairs of the same numbers (6-6, 3-3, 8-8) or those which add up to 10 (2-8, 3-7 etc). Two numbers can be removed by tapping on them one by one.\r\n- The pairs must be located side by side, and you can cross out them vertically, horizontally and also, if one number stands on the last cell in the line and another stands on the first cell in the following line of the grid. There can also be empty cells between the 2 numbers.\r\n- When there are no more numbers to remove, the remaining numbers can be added to the end.\r\n- The goal is to cross out all the numbers and empty the board.\r\n- You win when there are no numbers left on the field.\r\n\r\n<b>Beat your Number Clash - Math Game record!</b>\r\n\r\nSuch a logical puzzle with numbers can be solved in many different ways. But this is not so easy to achieve. Give your brain a workout and have fun!\r\n\r\nWhat awaits you when you download Number Clash - Math Game:\r\n\r\n\u2022 An easy-to-learn puzzle with numbers\r\n\u2022 Many hours of exciting gameplay\r\n\u2022 Daily challenges. Play every day, complete daily tasks for a month and get unique trophies\r\n\u2022 Hints with which you can quickly come to victory\r\n\u2022 No time limit \u2014 there is no hurry, decide at your own pace\r\n\r\nGet ready for a fun and exciting number match game! Install Number Clash - Math Game, give it a try, and share your feedback with us. Your opinion can make a difference!",
    "descriptionHTML": "<b>Discover the exciting new app, Number Clash - Math Game! Match your way to a higher score with this fun and challenging number game. Find pairs of numbers to clear the board in the best way to test your memory, improve your math skills, and have a blast with our addictive number puzzle.</b><br><br>Number Clash - Math Game is an engaging number puzzle app with straightforward rules: score and win by finding pairs of numbers and removing them from the board. Spend your free time wisely with Number Clash. Develop logical thinking, test your problem-solving skills, and enhance your focus\u2014all by playing this classic number match game.<br><br>This classic numbers game, also known as &quot;make ten&quot;, &quot;collect ten&quot;, &quot;numbers&quot;, &quot;seeds&quot; or &quot;column&quot;, will appeal to all number puzzle lovers.<br><br>Do you play and enjoy Sudoku or regular and Japanese crosswords and other number games? This number game app is perfect for you to boost brain power in your free time. Unobtrusive music and pleasant graphics add to the relaxing game experience.<br><br>Number Clash - Math Game is an engaging number puzzle app with simple rules. This game allows users to relax while matching pairs of numbers in grids. It helps develop basic math and arithmetic skills, improves concentration, and enhances problem-solving abilities. That&#39;s why Number Clash is an excellent learning tool for younger players!<br><br><b>How to play Number Clash - Math Game</b><br><br>- Cross out the pairs of the same numbers (6-6, 3-3, 8-8) or those which add up to 10 (2-8, 3-7 etc). Two numbers can be removed by tapping on them one by one.<br>- The pairs must be located side by side, and you can cross out them vertically, horizontally and also, if one number stands on the last cell in the line and another stands on the first cell in the following line of the grid. There can also be empty cells between the 2 numbers.<br>- When there are no more numbers to remove, the remaining numbers can be added to the end.<br>- The goal is to cross out all the numbers and empty the board.<br>- You win when there are no numbers left on the field.<br><br><b>Beat your Number Clash - Math Game record!</b><br><br>Such a logical puzzle with numbers can be solved in many different ways. But this is not so easy to achieve. Give your brain a workout and have fun!<br><br>What awaits you when you download Number Clash - Math Game:<br><br>\u2022 An easy-to-learn puzzle with numbers<br>\u2022 Many hours of exciting gameplay<br>\u2022 Daily challenges. Play every day, complete daily tasks for a month and get unique trophies<br>\u2022 Hints with which you can quickly come to victory<br>\u2022 No time limit \u2014 there is no hurry, decide at your own pace<br><br>Get ready for a fun and exciting number match game! Install Number Clash - Math Game, give it a try, and share your feedback with us. Your opinion can make a difference!",
